WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:06.339
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
on SHIELD, Cobie Smulders came back, we finally

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:11.709
found out who was behind Project TAHITI and
one of the best escape plans I’ve seen all

00:00:11.709 --> 00:00:12.709
season.

00:00:12.709 --> 00:00:16.670
I don’t know if it was because of Cobie’s
comedic background, but for a number of reasons

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.640
we can talk about the whole episode felt like
it was funnier.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.910
If you’re finding me for the first time.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:29.169
I’m doing weekly SHIELD videos and I do
bonus Marvel movies videos every Tuesday.

00:00:29.169 --> 00:00:31.759
Today we learned about the new Episode VII
cast, so naturally if a bomb like that gets

00:00:31.759 --> 00:00:33.840
dropped it ends up being the bonus video.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.010
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.770
As soon as SHIELD is over, Star Wars videos
will fill the Tuesday night Gap.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:42.790
So let’s talk about how awesome Robin Sparkles
is, careful for spoilers if you haven’t

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:43.790
seen the episode yet.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:45.030
But here are my top 5 moments.

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:47.350
Number 5 - Ward Is Hitler Youth

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:51.260
Their big fight was a nice explosion we’d
all been waiting to happen.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:55.110
I wasn’t really digging the Mr and Mrs Smith
diner scene so when they finally did have

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.300
it out on the Bus I was really happy.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.650
Usually when you put characters in these confessional
scenes is when the truth starts to come out.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.890
And we learned a couple things:

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:08.899
Skye knows the SHIELD handbook, Chapter 1,
Red Skull founded HYDRA, he was a super NAZI.

00:01:08.899 --> 00:01:11.259
Ergo all HYDRA Agents are probably Nazi’s.

00:01:11.259 --> 00:01:15.119
One of the funniest lines in the episode.

00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:19.049
And Skye is done with Ward, as expected, she
says she’s never going to give him what

00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:20.520
he wants.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:25.950
Meaning the information on the drive and her
cash and prizes.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:26.950
But that’s a lie isn’t it?

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:30.280
She totally gave up the drive when she thought
Deathlok was going to kill him.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:32.700
So I think that opens the door for a Ward
redemption arc.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.130
There was also some stuff later at the motel
that supports that theory.

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:37.159
Number 4 - Team Coulson On Vacation

00:01:37.159 --> 00:01:42.350
I love scenes like this when it’s just the
Team chilling together out in public.

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:46.740
It’s like that scene in Iron Man 2 when
Tony Stark goes to get Donuts and Nick Fury

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.630
and Black Widow share some coffee.

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:52.420
Maybe it’s just seeing super heroes doe
mundane everyday things like use a vending

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.499
machine and hang out by the pool?

00:01:54.499 --> 00:01:58.720
I think this is where the real character development
happens.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.990
Where you start to fall in love with these
people.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:05.710
If you ever watched any of Joss Whedon’s
older shows like Buffy or Angel or Firefly.

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:08.330
The best scenes where when they were just
hanging out being friends.

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:12.890
I’m not sure where the team is going to
be after the finale, Maria Hill told Coulson

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:17.379
to release them all to Stark Industries, but
I don’t see that happening.

00:02:17.379 --> 00:02:23.299
Especially since we know Nick Fury is still
alive.

00:02:23.299 --> 00:02:27.239
Fitz and Simmons also said something that
makes me think the show is laying groundwork

00:02:27.239 --> 00:02:28.420
for a Ward redemption.

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:32.690
Like when Fitz says he doesn’t believe that
some people are just evil.

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:36.269
It’s like Darth Vader in Return of the Jedi
all over again.

00:02:36.269 --> 00:02:39.830
Maybe that means Ward will throw Garrett down
an elevator shaft too.

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.409
Let me know if you agree.

00:02:41.409 --> 00:02:43.500
Number 3 - Cobie Smulders Is Back

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:48.090
I love the Maria Hill character, so naturally
when How I Met Your Mother ended I crossed

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:50.840
my fingers that she’d guest star on SHIELD
more often.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:54.800
That’s probably not going to happen, mostly
because her movie career is starting to take

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:57.239
off and she outranks Coulson.

00:02:57.239 --> 00:03:00.569
And really he should be the most powerful
main character week to week.

00:03:00.569 --> 00:03:04.129
She also moved back to New York to live with
her husband Tarran Killam who’s on SNL full

00:03:04.129 --> 00:03:06.489
time and SHIELD shoots in Los Angeles.

00:03:06.489 --> 00:03:10.220
But I think we can expect her to show up at
least three or four times during season 2.

00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:14.950
I loved the casual way she just name-dropped
Man Thing and Stark’s Army.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:18.970
Your brain naturally races to his Armory as
in hall of Armors.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:23.060
I’ll talk about that more in a future Avengers
video, but Joss Whedon is kind of glossing

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:24.680
over the end of Iron Man 3.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.650
So he’ll have multiple Armors again.

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:32.480
What I’d really like to see from her if
she’s in the finale at all is a full on

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.480
fight scene.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.480
Like with Garrett.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.799
She’s supposed to be one of the most fearsome
SHIELD agents, so why isn’t she punching

00:03:37.799 --> 00:03:39.239
more people like May does?

00:03:39.239 --> 00:03:43.590
Number 2 - Lola Is The New Escape Plan
One of the best escapes all season.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:47.609
I can only imagine how much the spent on that
effect but all I could think when they backed

00:03:47.609 --> 00:03:52.989
the car out and Skye flew up in the air was
“that’s why you wear a seatbelt”.

00:03:52.989 --> 00:03:56.950
Disney is a family company, so if feel like
they could run this scene by itself as a seat

00:03:56.950 --> 00:04:00.290
belt safety PSA in schools.

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:02.859
Coulson’s reaction to Deathlok was priceless
too.

00:04:02.859 --> 00:04:06.370
His Oh Shit face is going to be one of my
favorite gifs from the episode.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.780
New plan, run.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:11.069
and my Number 1 moment - The Man Behind TAHITI
Is Revealed

00:04:11.069 --> 00:04:12.970
I did not see this coming.

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:14.489
Coulson being the man behind TAHITI.

00:04:14.489 --> 00:04:18.030
I saw a lot of you commenting on Twitter that
this was confusing.

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:19.720
So here’s what was going on.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:24.620
Nick Fury commissioned project TAHITI as a
way of using alien, probably Kree, DNA to

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:28.380
develop regenerative drugs that they could
use on mortally wounded Avengers.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.550
So say Tony Stark or Black Widow almost dies
or does die.

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:34.430
They wanted a procedure that could bring them
back to life.

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:38.000
Like the Mirakuru on Arrow, minus the super
strength.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.060
But just like on Arrow with the mirakuru.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:43.180
The alien blood made everyone flip their shit.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:46.270
The only way to fix the problem was to re-write
the people’s memories.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:51.430
Because it was so shady, Coulson tendered
his resignation and advised Nick Fury to scrap

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:52.590
the project.

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:58.030
What probably happened was Fury did scrap
the project, but then when Coulson died during

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.800
Avengers, it was still sitting there in the
bunker.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.950
So he used it that once on Coulson and based
on Coulson’s notes.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.650
Knew that the had to re-write his memory.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:08.590
So that he wouldn’t go crazy and die.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:13.000
So Fury wasn’t trying to be shady, he just
wanted Coulson to be stable and alive.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.120
But because they weren’t sure, Fury ordered
May to watch him.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.099
Samuel L. Jackson is guest starring in the
finale.

00:05:18.099 --> 00:05:22.090
So I’m sure there will be a scene where
the two of them resolve the issue.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.090
But now it’s your turn.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:24.560
Let me know what you’re favorite moment
was.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:28.000
Cobie Smulders, TAHITI or Lola?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.699
I think we should call Chloe Bennett’s Haircut
after they landed the Lola.

00:05:30.699 --> 00:05:37.039
All it will be is you sitting in front of
a blow drier for fifteen minutes.

00:05:37.039 --> 00:05:39.130
Perfect for Halloween.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.650
Overall I gave the episode a B plus.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:44.050
I loved seeing Maria Hill again and the way
they used her character to create a bridge

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:46.990
between Winter Soldier and Avengers 2.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.870
Remember she said they’re privatizing World
Security.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.230
That’s going to be a thing in Avengers Age
of Ultron.

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:55.080
We can talk more about that in a future video.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:06:00.690
But I’m really glad the Skye and Ward drama
is over.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.310
And now they can just start punishing each
other with Hitler Jokes.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:06.250
The Coulson TAHITI twist was a nice wrinkle.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:10.190
I’m actually surprised that the mystery
has gone on this long.

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:15.930
I wasn’t super invested in it and I think
a lot of us thought it might be another Alexander

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:20.400
Pierce HYDRA reveal but I like the real explanation
better.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:23.580
No one can hurt you like your friends.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.630
He and Nick Fury are going to have some serious
words.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:30.220
I’m really excited to see where the end
of this season leaves the team.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:34.320
I don’t expect them to disband, but they
might take funding from Tony Stark.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:38.000
I have a feeling he’ll be funding the Avengers
during Age of Ultron.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.580
Remember, privatizing world security.

